cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, models or data, please cite them as below (and the associated manuscripts when published)."
title: "TinyPhaseNet: code, trained models and device measurements for a depthwise separable seismic phase picker compressed for TinyML"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
abstract: >-
  Code, trained models (seeds 42, 43 and 44), ESP32-S3 firmware with a replacement transposed-convolution kernel, raw device measurement logs,
  result files, and the scripts that regenerate the tables and figures of two manuscripts on post-training quantization and depthwise separable
  convolution of a seismic phase picker (TinyPhaseNet) and its standard-convolution counterpart (PhaseNet). No waveform is redistributed.
